{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12366","headline":"送丁着作佐台郡 · 钱起","name":"送丁着作佐台郡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多年金马客，名遂动归轮。\n佐郡紫书下，过门朱绶新。\n扬舲望海岳，入境背风尘。\n水驿偏乘月，梅园别受春。\n带经临府吏，鱠鲤待乡人。\n始见美高士，逍遥在搢绅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}